# The desert town's mayor — receives the water spirits. Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@speaker Desert Mayor

== greet ==
A traveler, here? We have little to offer... Wait. Is that the hum of water spirits? Mayor Arse sent you, didn't he?
> Hand over the water spirits. -> thanks [item water_spirits] [set delivered_water_spirits]
> Not yet.

== thanks ==
The spirits sing in your hands... Yes. With these I can wake the springs beneath the sand. Thank you, traveler. Our town will not forget this.
